                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwandisampaula akati kabantu bangu kuti mujane inkankamaanza zyabbaale aminsuma yansima. Mwajaya bantu bateelede kufwa akuponya bantu bateelede kupona, Mwacita obo kukubeja kwanu mumatwi aabantu bangu baswiilila zyakubeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
